Repair\n1494:### 9.4 Garbage collection roots\n1505:## 10. Deterministic build, install, PATH, and rollback\n1532:## 11. Signing and notarization boundary\n1552:## 12. Future closed-driver rule\n1573:## 13. Threat model\n1575:### 13.1 Adversary-controlled\n1583:### 13.2 Trusted computing base\n1592:### 13.3 Required controls\n1617:## 14. Exact impact on existing board work\n1621:### 14.1 Existing curator-spec schema-6 story\n1638:### 14.2 Existing Curator implementation story\n1652:### 14.3 Existing cocoaskills implementation story\n1658:### 14.4 Existing interoperability story\n1672:## 15. Rejected alternatives\n1693:## 16. Primary-source register\n1741:## 17. Validation and independent-review checks\n1794:### 17.1 Producer verification evidence\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
